<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 1-month, 3-month BUBOR rates both 22.75pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary 1-month, 3-month BUBOR rates both 22.75pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) remained unchanged for both the one- and three-month maturities, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The one-month and the three-month rate were both fixed at 22.75 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom, +36 1 327 4040</p>
